Plate being difficult to maneuver in is a common myth. I've seen guys in
plate armor doing cartwheels and riverdancing. That whole business about
knights needing to be winched onto their horses, or being unable to stand
up if they got knocked down is about as real as a 30 pound broadsword, or a
